 <name>duckdb</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Native DuckDB driver for PHP</summary>
 <description>
  Native PHP extension providing a driver for DuckDB (https://duckdb.org),
  an in-process analytical database, via the stable DuckDB C API.

  Features: synchronous and streaming queries, prepared statements with
  positional and named parameters, PDO-style transaction helpers, the
  Appender API for bulk inserts, asynchronous execution on background
  threads (with cancellation, progress reporting, Fiber suspension and
  event-loop integration) plus a single-threaded pending/polling mode,
  a typed exception hierarchy mirroring DuckDB's error categories, and
  full type coverage (nested types, exact decimals, temporal types as
  DateTimeImmutable, ENUM, UUID, BIT, BLOB, INTERVAL).
 </description>
 <lead>
  <name>Martin Juul Christiansen</name>
