  <api>1.0.0</api>
 </version>
 <stability>
  <release>stable</release>
  <api>stable</api>
 </stability>
 <license uri="https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT">MIT</license>
 <notes>
  First stable release.

  - Database/Connection/Statement/Result/ResultIterator/PendingQuery/
    Appender/Interval classes, FetchMode and ErrorType enums.
  - Typed exception hierarchy (ConnectionException, ParserException,
    BinderException, CatalogException, ConstraintException,
    ConversionException, TransactionException, IOException,
    InterruptedException, InternalException) carrying DuckDB error
    categories.
  - Streaming results with stale-stream detection, forward-only iterators.
  - Async: queryAsync()/executeAsync() on worker threads with cancel(),
    completion stream/fd and Fiber suspend(); queryPending()
    single-threaded polling mode.
  - Connection close()/isClosed()/queryProgress()/interrupt()/
    getTableNames(), PDO-style beginTransaction()/commit()/rollBack().
  - Appender with appendRow() and piecemeal
    beginRow()/append()/appendDefault()/endRow().
  - Full .phpt test suite (run-tests.php).
 </notes>
