 <!--
  Note: the DuckDB C API library (libduckdb, v1.1+; v1.5.x recommended) and
  duckdb.h are required at build time. Pass the configure flag
  with-duckdb=DIR, where DIR contains include/duckdb.h and
  lib/libduckdb. libduckdb must also be available at runtime (e.g. in
  the linker path).
